# Original photographs are deliberately NOT ignored, same reasoning as photos/.
# They are the only copy, they are consented (photos/CONSENT.md), and the WebPs
# in photos/web are downsampled and cannot be re-cropped or re-encoded larger.
# ~48 MB, which is worth it. This repo must stay PRIVATE: it carries the
# operator's identity, their registration numbers and consent records.
